            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="p-3.5 border-t border-slate-850 space-y-3.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div>
              <label class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Bank Remittance Placement</label>
              <select id="config-remittance-placement" class="w-full rounded border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs focus:ring-0">
                <option value="both" selected>Show on Last Page & TOS Page</option>
                <option value="page1">Show on Last Page Only</option>
                <option value="tos">Show on TOS Page Only</option>
                <option value="none">Hide Remittance Entirely</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/40">
              <label class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Select Bank Account</label>
